{
  "$Comment": [
    "The Nightmare chase's end-of-run spoils, rolled by the player's score when the round is won.",
    "",
    "Rolls  - what everybody who wins takes home, whatever they scored.",
    "Pool   - the part that varies. Pool.Rolls says how many picks the run earns: two to start,",
    "         plus one more per 1800 points (the weight is 1 divided by 1800), never more than 5.",
    "         Entries compete by Weight and are drawn with replacement, so one can come up twice.",
    "",
    "Richer than Amateur on every axis: a bigger baseline, more picks, and premium entries that",
    "unlock at higher scores. To retune, change the weights, the counts, or the thresholds.",
    "Another mod can ADD entries by shipping a lootable with \"ContributesTo\": \"chase_nightmare\"."
  ],
